  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{首|くび}→首：00792_kubi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{傾|かたむ}ける (tilt one's head — often expressing puzzlement)\n- ⟦{耳|みみ}→耳：01513_mimi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{傾|かたむ}ける (listen attentively)\n- ⟦{情熱|じょうねつ}→情熱：05087_jounetsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{傾|かたむ}ける (devote one's passion)\n- ⟦{全力|ぜんりょく}→全力：11637_zenryoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{傾|かたむ}ける (pour all one's efforts)\n- ⟦グラス→グラス：00076_gurasu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{傾|かたむ}ける (raise/tilt a glass — implies drinking)\n\nThe phrase ⟦{耳|みみ}→耳：01513_mimi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{傾|かたむ}ける is a set expression meaning to listen carefully or pay attention to someone's words.",
